     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "用挂钟和艺术品装饰墙面的技巧",
     "text": "浏览页面内容，了解如何将钟表与裱框艺术品结合起来，打造美观别致的画廊墙或重新利用闲置的角落，为空间增添美感、功能和情调。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250715/2d78829ad9c14e06969c00289d2e6329.JPG",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/living-room/how-to/create-a-timeless-yet-timely-gallery-wall-combining-clocks-and-framed-art-pubfd1fbe1c",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "人造植物让家居焕然一新的创意",
     "text": "以下是为你精心准备的人造植物和人造花布置技巧，无需阳光与浇水就能让家焕发生机，尽显迷人的活力！",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250710/2348b435413e451cacaebc79cf991fef.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/living-room/how-to/4-ideas-for-year-round-greenery-with-artificial-plants-pubef442ab4",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "什么颜色和元素与褐色真皮沙发相配？",
     "text": "想找一些关于布置褐色真皮沙发的灵感？可以使用哪些颜色、图案、配件和家具来搭配？浏览这些小贴士，从中获取灵感。",
     "image": "https://content-service-oss.aidesign.ingka-internal.cn/content-hub/f96ef328-1efa-4dd7-befb-0fa4910a9d15/a60d061e-0f77-40fb-ad6e-9b1f757a7e7e.jpeg",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/living-room/how-to/what-colours-go-with-a-brown-leather-sofa-pub0bfd61a7",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "如何在客厅摆放L型沙发",
     "text": "想找一些关于在家中摆放L型沙发的灵感？还想知道如何布置沙发，挑选匹配的家具？在这里获取技巧和灵感。",
     "image": "https://content-service-oss.aidesign.ingka-internal.cn/content-hub/f96ef328-1efa-4dd7-befb-0fa4910a9d15/cadb3a75-f9f6-4892-8d01-882042b6afdf.jpeg",
